<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Oct jobless unchanged at 3.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Czech Oct jobless unchanged at 3.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic in October totalled 170,471 or 3.2 percent of the workforce, unchanged from September, the Labour and Social Affairs Ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>  CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT    OCT 1996    SEPT 1996     OCT 1995</p>
<p>  number of jobless     170,471	169,024	146,140</p>
<p>  pct of workforce	  3.2	    3.2	    2.8</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
